<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34372" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμ-πλάσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plaster up</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν
				πατέρα ἐν σμύρνῃ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.73
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσφάλτῳ ἐμπλασθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					16.1.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stuff in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρὸν εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					919b9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>stop up</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ φλέβια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				66
			</span></i>; <i>clog</i> the teeth of a saw, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.6.3
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πλασσομένων τῶν πόρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Sens.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>form in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρία ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					78.25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>cause to adhere</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ γαστρὶ χυμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.428
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				15.204
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> abs., <i>to
				be viscous</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.495
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>have an impression left</i> or <i>made</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.116
			</span></i>, al.</div>
